<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, man... My boss finna KILL me...\rThe FARFETCH’D that cut trees for\ncharcoal ran off in the forest. Both of\f’em.\rCan you catch ’em? FARFETCH’D got\nsensitive ears.\rStep on a branch and they turn toward\nthe noise. That’s your chance.\rSneak up from behind and grab ’em...\nLike a ninja. Or a repo man.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh! You found a FARFETCH’D!\nGood looks!\rBut...\nOne more still missin’.\rStep on a branch and it look\nthat way, remember?\rThat’s your chance to grab it.\nSneak up slow from behind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHEESH! You got BOTH of ’em!\fGood looks, for REAL!\rMy boss’ homies won’t listen to me\n’cause I ain’t got a Chain. They laugh\fat me.\rPhew. You saved my job. Again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FARFETCH’D: Kwaa!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FARFETCH’D: Kwaa!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} grabbed the FARFETCH’D!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AH! My Far and Fetch’d!\rYou found ’em, youngblood? Without\n’em, no charcoal. No charcoal, no\fbread. No bread, no rent.\rGOOD LOOKS!\rHow can I pay you back...? I got it!\nHere, take this. My apprentice\fcan’t have it. He lost ’em in the first\nplace.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s the HM Shank. Teach it to a\nhomie to clear lil trees.\rYou gotta have the Block Chain\nfrom Azalea to use it, though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna apprentice as a charcoal\nmaker?\rYou’ll be top tier in ten years! The pay\nis ash. Literally.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What am I doin’?\rI’m shakin’ trees with Dome Check.\rIt’s fun. Here, try it with your\nhomie too! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna try it with your\nhomie? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nProtect your dome, then. Helmet up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which homie should learn it?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm...\nEven I can’t teach a Egg a move.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad...\nThat homie can’t learn Dome Check.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} tryna learn\nDome Check.\rBut {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} can’t hold more\nthan four moves.\rForget an old move to make\nroom for Dome Check? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cool to forget the\nmove {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stop teachin’ Dome Check? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} BONK!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} BONK!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There. How you like that? Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\nlookin’ HARDER! Thick skull!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\nalready know Dome Check.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} forgot how to\nuse {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\rAnd...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned Dome Check.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned Dome Check!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler Tips!\rIlex Forest so overgrown you\ncan’t even see the sky.\rKeep an eye out for stuff\npeople dropped. Finders keepers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ilex Forest Shrine...\rA tribute to the forest’s protector...\nSomebody left a Takis bag. Respect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dancer, Dancer, lost and all alone.\nPoor girl lost in the dark Ilex Forest.\fShe can’t read a map. Never could.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? You remember me from Violet City?\fYou trippin’. That was my twin.\rAnyway, you gon’ show me how to get\noutta this forest? I been here since\fTuesday. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You will...?\nAin’t you lost in here too?\fHow you know the way out?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh my... You lost too, ain’t you?\nWe both gon’ die in here. Beautifully.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHEESH! You gon’ show me the way out?\fYou SUCH a smart homie! You got GPS in\fyour brain!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Later.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FARFETCH’D heard you!\nIt turn toward the noise\fwhen you step on a branch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta grab it from behind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You snuck up and grabbed it from\nbehind before it noticed!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a PICHU...!\nOne of its ears is all spiky!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It wanna roll with your crew.\nLet it join!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spiky-eared PICHU joined\nyour crew!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Your crew full!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Your crew full!\rGo stash a homie in a PC Box first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spiky-eared PICHU: Zapzap chu!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the Hood Ball!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give the Spiky-eared PICHU\na nickname? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO, AYO! Don’t mess with that shrine!\fPeople be DISAPPEARIN’.\fMy cousin touched it. Still waitin’ on\nhim.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kids and homies be disappearin’ around\nthis shrine sometimes.\rPeople think a homie that travel\nthrough time do it. I think it’s the\fgovernment.\rIt’s real strange...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, well, this gotta be...\rThis the PICHU that been livin’ in\nthis forest a long time.\rFirst time I saw it, it looked\nlonely. It’s mad hype today.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see.\nLooks like these old homies\ffinally linked up again.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You carryin’ a lotta homies.\rWhy don’t you drop one off\nat the Trap House?\fI’ll hold it down till then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bein’ with homies gon’ make it happy.\nTake care of it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, here it is! Young Hustler, I’ma give\nyou this Hood Ball.\rI used these back in my day. In 1952.\rDon’t trip. It still work fine. Mostly.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Looks like Spiky-eared PICHU\nwanna stay in your Hood Ball.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You named it {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?\nThat’s so cute!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It been waitin’ on you\nthis whole time.\rTalk to it. It’ll make its day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou heard about the legend of\fthe shrine?\rThey say people disappear when\nthey mess with it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou heard about the legend of\fthe shrine?\rThey say people disappear when\nthey mess with it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: ...\nWhat was THAT?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: ...\nWhat was THAT?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Time travel\nREALLY don’t feel good.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Time travel\nREALLY don’t feel good.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, my MARILL!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, my MARILL!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I thought I’d never see you again!\rWait a sec...\nSo we back in our own time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I missed you so much!\rWait a sec...\nSo we back in our own time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That was mad weird.\nBut now we back in our own\ftime and The Feds’ evil plan\ffell through, so...\fall’s well that ends well, right?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you always pullin’ me\ninto crazy adventures!\rThat was a long day, though.\nI’ma head out.\rLater!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0115_D36R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That was mad weird.\nBut now we back in our own\ftime and The Feds’ evil plan\ffell through, so...\fall’s well that ends well, right?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you always pullin’ me\ninto crazy adventures!\rThat was a long day, though.\nI’ma head out.\rLater!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
